re os planos de Alecrim. A conversa completa não informa o canal pelo qual conheceu a academia.", "origin_conversation_fully_expanded": "true", "origin_manual_history_result": "digital_channel_not_confirmed"}}, {"lead": "56018713", "contact": "53136401", "payload": {"origin_conversation_initiator": "contact", "origin_conversation_first_at": "2026-11-03T08:35:00-03:00", "origin_conversation_context": "Rafa chamou para consultar os planos e confirmou que já foi aluna em 2023/2024. Nenhum canal de aquisição anterior foi informado.", "origin_conversation_fully_expanded": "true", "origin_manual_history_result": "digital_channel_not_confirmed"}}, {"lead": "56021141", "contact": "53138491", "payload": {"origin_conversation_initiator": "contact", "origin_conversation_first_at": "2026-11-03T10:28:00-03:00", "origin_conversation_context": "Nanderson, já aluno, chamou para cancelar o plano. É uma conversa de atendimento; a origem anterior de aquisição não aparece no histórico.", "origin_conversation_fully_expanded": "true", "origin_manual_history_result": "digital_channel_not_confirmed"}}, {"lead": "56021449", "contact": "53138791", "payload": {"origin_conversation_initiator": "commercial", "origin_conversation_first_at": "2026-11-03T10:43:00-03:00", "origin_conversation_context": "O comercial enviou um convite para retomar o atendimento. Laiza respondeu Continuar; não há conversa anterior de aquisição disponível neste cadastro.", "origin_conversation_fully_expanded": "true", "origin_manual_history_result": "digital_channel_not_confirmed"}}, {"lead": "56030765", "contact": "53145607", "payload": {"origin_conversation_initiator": "contact", "origin_conversation_first_at": "2026-11-03T14:30:00-03:00", "origin_conversation_context": "Brunella chamou para consultar planos e afirmou que já visitou a unidade e mora ou trabalha perto. A conversa não identifica um canal digital.", "origin_conversation_fully_expanded": "true", "origin_manual_history_result": "digital_channel_not_confirmed"}}, {"lead": "56032533", "contact": "53147691", "payload": {"origin_conversation_initiator": "commercial", "origin_conversation_first_at": "2026-11-03T15:38:00-03:00", "origin_conversation_context": "O comercial cadastrou o telefone e enviou o convite para continuar o atendimento. Mara respondeu Continuar; o histórico não informa como ela conheceu a academia.", "origin_conversation_fully_expanded": "true", "origin_manual_history_result": "digital_channel_not_confirmed"}}]'::jsonb)),
 firsts AS (SELECT DISTINCT ON(payload->>'contact_id') entity_key,occurred_at,payload FROM public.wa_tracking_records WHERE connection_id='1fd22072-6932-4122-941f-cb31c55efd66' AND entity='messages' ORDER BY payload->>'contact_id',occurred_at,entity_key)
 UPDATE public.wa_tracking_records r SET
 payload=r.payload||(e.value->'payload')||jsonb_build_object('origin_conversation_reviewed_at',now()::text,'origin_manual_history_checked_at',now()::text),revision=r.revision+1,synced_at=now()
 FROM firsts f JOIN evidence e ON f.payload->>'kommo_lead_id'=e.value->>'lead' AND f.payload->>'kommo_contact_id'=e.value->>'contact'
 WHERE r.connection_id='1fd22072-6932-4122-941f-cb31c55efd66' AND r.entity='messages' AND r.entity_key=f.entity_key
 AND f.occurred_at>='2026-11-01T03:00:00Z' AND f.occurred_at<'2026-11-04T03:00:00Z'
 AND r.payload->>'origin_manual_history_scope'='visible_kommo_timeline'
 AND coalesce(r.payload->>'utm_source','')='' AND coalesce(r.payload->>'gclid','')='' AND coalesce(r.payload->>'fbclid','')='';
 GET DIAGNOSTICS affected=ROW_COUNT;
 IF affected<>17 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Unexpected review scope: %',affected; END IF;
END $review$;
